# CPython tests that python-hs can run.
#
# Formats:
#   path::ClassName::methodName  (single method)
#   path::ClassName              (all test* methods in the class)
#   path                         (all test* methods in the file)
#
# Stability rules:
# - Entries must pass deterministically without network, wall-clock time,
#   randomness, or writes outside the repository.
# - Methods that need an unsupported module or platform-specific value are
#   excluded rather than skipped at runtime.
# - A failing entry is removed until the underlying gap is fixed; the runner
#   never reports a case as skipped.
